      <p class="font-mono text-sm tracking-wide text-muted-foreground mb-6">Software Engineer</p>
      <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-caveat mb-4 leading-tight">
        Fairy Pitta
      </h1>
      <div class="w-16 h-px bg-[hsl(var(--accent))] mb-8"></div>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-10 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        Building tools for education and nature through clean, purposeful code.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a
          href="#projects"
